WEBVTT

01:41.770 --> 01:49.020
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.430 --> 01:51.990
[Episode 27]

01:54.200 --> 01:56.509
Shen Fuxuan is
the only one absent today, right?

01:56.509 --> 01:57.920
He has a shift at the hospital.

01:57.920 --> 01:58.979
He told me about it.

02:00.000 --> 02:01.070
Listen to this.

02:01.200 --> 02:03.120
It's good to be busy. Let him be.

02:03.430 --> 02:04.230
Listen.

02:04.560 --> 02:05.710
Sorry, guys.

02:06.120 --> 02:07.870
I'm on duty today
and really can't make it.

02:07.870 --> 02:08.930
I'll treat you guys

02:08.960 --> 02:09.710
next time.

02:11.080 --> 02:12.010
All right, Shen.

02:12.080 --> 02:13.000
It's a deal!

02:13.190 --> 02:14.000
That's it.

02:14.000 --> 02:14.960
It's a voice message,

02:14.960 --> 02:16.000
not a phone call.

02:19.560 --> 02:20.840
When I saw the message today,

02:20.840 --> 02:22.590
saying Zeqiu was going to treat us
to a meal—

02:22.590 --> 02:23.190
I'm not exaggerating—

02:23.190 --> 02:24.520
I really read it 3 times.

02:24.520 --> 02:26.750
Zeqiu would treat us to a meal?

02:27.750 --> 02:28.810
I felt the same way.

02:29.630 --> 02:30.910
Have I never treated you guys before?

02:30.910 --> 02:32.400
Nope.

02:33.470 --> 02:34.280
Exactly!

02:34.560 --> 02:35.190
Zeqiu,

02:35.360 --> 02:36.800
why on earth are you treating us

02:36.800 --> 02:38.000
to this meal?

02:38.000 --> 02:40.120
If you don't tell us, we dare not eat.

02:40.560 --> 02:43.090
You ungrateful people
really broke my heart.

02:44.190 --> 02:45.680
Don't talk about my brother like that.

02:45.680 --> 02:47.680
My brother is just somewhat frugal.

02:47.800 --> 02:49.560
We should encourage this behavior.

02:49.560 --> 02:52.360
Then maybe he'll finally
spend more in the future.

02:52.360 --> 02:54.090
So you are the biggest ingrate.

02:55.400 --> 02:57.200
Alright, let's get to the point.

02:58.360 --> 02:59.870
There is indeed some serious news

02:59.870 --> 03:01.670
I'd like to share with everyone.

03:03.280 --> 03:04.680
Our Dr. Lin Zhixia's

03:04.680 --> 03:07.030
application for a national key
scientific research project

03:07.030 --> 03:07.590
got approved.

03:07.590 --> 03:08.720
A round of applause!

03:10.310 --> 03:12.560
Congratulations
on achieving one more goal.

03:12.560 --> 03:14.560
Zhixia, you really make me proud.

03:14.630 --> 03:15.870
It's a national project!

03:15.870 --> 03:18.070
I have something else to brag about now.

03:18.560 --> 03:20.430
I also helped with this, right?

03:20.430 --> 03:21.840
Shut up. Nobody asked.

03:22.630 --> 03:24.360
Tell Mom and Dad about this later.

03:24.360 --> 03:26.030
They will be happy for you, too.

03:26.030 --> 03:26.630
Yeah.

03:26.630 --> 03:28.680
Lin Zhixia has prepared
for this project for so long.

03:28.680 --> 03:29.840
Her efforts have finally paid off.

03:29.840 --> 03:31.360
Come on, I propose a toast

03:31.360 --> 03:32.280
to her achievement!

03:32.280 --> 03:33.240
-Absolutely, cheers.
-Cheers.

03:33.240 --> 03:33.960
Hold on.

03:34.079 --> 03:34.960
Jiang Yubai,

03:35.520 --> 03:37.680
Zeqiu is celebrating for his sister.

03:38.120 --> 03:40.520
So in what capacity are you

03:40.520 --> 03:41.910
proposing this toast?

03:42.680 --> 03:43.150
I...

03:43.360 --> 03:45.960
As the doctor's family, of course.

03:48.590 --> 03:50.120
Jiang, you have to drink this up.

03:50.120 --> 03:50.870
I'll drink it up.

03:50.870 --> 03:52.120
-Come on.
-Cheers!

03:52.430 --> 03:53.150
Cheers.

03:58.870 --> 04:01.030
That was a toast to Lin Zhixia.

04:01.160 --> 04:03.020
I have one more thing to announce.

04:03.080 --> 04:03.960
Well...

04:06.150 --> 04:07.240
Jin Baihui and I

04:10.150 --> 04:11.350
are getting married.

04:14.000 --> 04:15.280
G-Getting married?

04:15.430 --> 04:16.310
Getting married.

04:16.310 --> 04:17.240
This is big news!

04:17.240 --> 04:18.720
Am I the only one who didn't know?

04:18.720 --> 04:19.800
No, I really didn't know this.

04:19.800 --> 04:21.529
I hadn't heard a thing about it.

04:21.550 --> 04:23.920
I only knew a tiny part of it.

04:25.480 --> 04:27.630
I knew even less than a tiny part.

04:28.720 --> 04:29.360
What...

04:29.360 --> 04:30.920
Good for you, Zeqiu.

04:30.920 --> 04:33.360
You've been working on
something so big secretly.

04:33.360 --> 04:33.950
Baihui,

04:33.950 --> 04:35.360
are we going to change how we address you

04:35.360 --> 04:37.480
and call you "sister-in-law"?

04:37.830 --> 04:39.159
Let's hear it.

04:39.360 --> 04:42.090
Getting me to change
how I address you is not easy.

04:43.720 --> 04:45.120
You don't need to change.

04:46.190 --> 04:47.830
I don't mean to be a wet blanket,

04:47.830 --> 04:49.430
but what about your parents?

04:52.870 --> 04:54.360
We've already made up our minds.

04:54.360 --> 04:55.430
We will be together

04:55.720 --> 04:57.050
no matter what they say.

05:03.000 --> 05:03.560
Hold on.

05:04.560 --> 05:06.240
I knew

05:06.390 --> 05:07.510
there must be

05:08.030 --> 05:11.090
something fishy
about this rare meal you treated us to.

05:11.720 --> 05:12.750
Lin Zhixia,

05:13.270 --> 05:14.510
Lin Zeqiu,

05:15.080 --> 05:17.240
you two want to use this one meal

05:17.360 --> 05:19.630
to celebrate two happy events?

05:19.800 --> 05:21.000
Is that appropriate?

05:21.160 --> 05:22.720
Yeah, it shouldn't be this simple.

05:22.720 --> 05:24.120
You should at least
treat us to another meal, right?

05:24.120 --> 05:24.870
At least two.

05:24.870 --> 05:26.600
Fine, fine, as many meals as you want.

05:26.600 --> 05:28.000
Let's see if they can
stop you from whining.

05:28.000 --> 05:29.360
Since the "sister-in-law" said so,

05:29.360 --> 05:30.240
let's have a toast.

05:30.240 --> 05:31.830
-Come on. Cheers.
-Cheers.

05:31.950 --> 05:33.870
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

05:38.120 --> 05:39.270
Can we start eating now?

05:39.270 --> 05:40.270
Eat up.

05:40.270 --> 05:40.920
There's nothing else, huh?

05:40.920 --> 05:41.680
No.

05:52.310 --> 05:55.310
I was really happy
having dinner with everyone today.

05:56.270 --> 05:57.310
Since you're home,

05:57.310 --> 05:59.920
I'm heading back now.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.180
How about you stay?

06:04.070 --> 06:04.950
Okay.

06:17.480 --> 06:19.410
You're going to sleep on the floor?

06:20.310 --> 06:22.000
Yep, I'll sleep here.

06:23.720 --> 06:25.240
Aren't you my boyfriend?

06:25.480 --> 06:26.740
We can sleep together.

07:00.510 --> 07:02.070
I'm so happy today.

07:10.240 --> 07:11.950
Your heart is racing.

07:13.920 --> 07:15.050
What's on your mind?

07:18.630 --> 07:19.680
I'm wondering

07:22.480 --> 07:23.680
if I can kiss you.

08:06.020 --> 08:07.910
♪ Warm fishbowl ♪

08:08.680 --> 08:10.540
♪ Glass sprouts forth ♪

08:10.740 --> 08:12.610
♪ Drowning at dusk ♪

08:13.560 --> 08:15.180
♪ You come to save me ♪

08:15.600 --> 08:17.410
♪ Such oddities ♪

08:18.450 --> 08:20.250
♪ Bizarre dreams ♪

08:20.630 --> 08:22.470
♪ You call them ♪

08:23.700 --> 08:25.050
♪ Déjà vu ♪

08:25.560 --> 08:26.940
♪ A random cut-in ♪

08:28.120 --> 08:29.790
♪ 2013 ♪

08:30.230 --> 08:31.990
♪ 16 times faster ♪

08:32.909 --> 08:34.870
♪ The night is like a window ♪

08:37.789 --> 08:39.440
Why did you turn off the light?

08:39.440 --> 08:40.240
To sleep.

08:40.789 --> 08:42.520
Do you sleep with the lights on?

08:46.150 --> 08:48.360
By sleeping, you mean...

09:33.480 --> 09:34.480
Dad, you're here.

09:35.790 --> 09:36.720
Mr. and Mrs. Jin.

09:37.670 --> 09:38.930
What's this all about?

09:39.150 --> 09:40.510
Please sit down first.

09:41.670 --> 09:42.600
Mom, have a seat.

09:48.870 --> 09:49.600
Well...

09:50.150 --> 09:51.080
Mr. and Mrs. Jin,

09:51.750 --> 09:52.270
today...

09:52.270 --> 09:53.330
You sit down first.

09:56.440 --> 09:57.910
I'd like to discuss with you
the relationship

09:57.910 --> 09:59.370
between Jin Baihui and me.

10:00.390 --> 10:02.590
We don't approve of your relationship.

10:05.120 --> 10:07.000
You called and asked us to have a talk.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.660
I thought you had come around.

10:09.480 --> 10:10.610
Mom, actually, I...

10:11.600 --> 10:12.790
Lin Zeqiu and I...

10:12.870 --> 10:13.510
Lin,

10:14.720 --> 10:16.450
let's make things clear today.

10:17.670 --> 10:21.270
Our family doesn't approve
of you and Jin Baihui being together,

10:21.480 --> 10:24.010
because I don't think
you two are a good match.

10:24.630 --> 10:26.000
Given your family background,

10:26.000 --> 10:27.120
your job,

10:27.720 --> 10:29.450
and your financial situation,

10:29.720 --> 10:31.980
you're not suitable for her in every way.

10:35.080 --> 10:38.280
Jin Baihui should find someone
with a better background.

10:38.720 --> 10:39.390
Of course,

10:40.000 --> 10:42.840
you could also find someone
with a better background.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.240
This way, you'll face much less stress

10:44.240 --> 10:45.440
in life in the future.

10:47.240 --> 10:49.170
We are doing this for your own good.

10:50.240 --> 10:51.080
At your age,

10:51.080 --> 10:53.600
you think marriage is all about love.

10:53.750 --> 10:54.720
We got it,

10:55.320 --> 10:57.440
because we were also once your age.

10:59.150 --> 11:00.750
But at our age,

11:01.080 --> 11:02.940
we know the truth about marriage.

11:03.750 --> 11:05.120
This is the last chance

11:05.550 --> 11:06.600
for you to change

11:06.790 --> 11:08.840
the course of your lives.

11:09.080 --> 11:10.550
This is a big deal,

11:11.550 --> 11:12.630
not a joke.

11:14.150 --> 11:15.610
Since we are on this topic,

11:16.070 --> 11:18.330
we don't want to make things too awkward.

11:19.600 --> 11:21.600
You two should break up peacefully.

11:23.840 --> 11:24.770
Mr. and Mrs. Jin,

11:24.870 --> 11:25.750
I understand what you mean.

11:25.750 --> 11:27.010
How about we eat first?

11:27.150 --> 11:27.960
Baihui specifically ordered

11:27.960 --> 11:29.220
your favorite dishes.

11:30.630 --> 11:33.230
-Let's talk over dinner.
-Actually, today...

11:35.910 --> 11:37.910
I'm here to inform you of something.

11:39.630 --> 11:40.750
Lin Zeqiu and I have

11:42.480 --> 11:44.120
already registered our marriage.

11:44.120 --> 11:44.910
What?

11:47.630 --> 11:49.760
These are our marriage certificates.

11:52.600 --> 11:53.530
Mr. and Mrs. Jin,

11:53.870 --> 11:56.080
although this decision
was made a bit hastily,

11:56.080 --> 11:57.790
we have thought it through.

11:57.810 --> 11:59.320
Jin Baihui, are you crazy?

12:00.670 --> 12:01.840
Mrs. Jin, this is mostly...

12:01.840 --> 12:02.360
Shut up!

12:04.870 --> 12:05.550
Jin Baihui,

12:05.870 --> 12:07.600
are you going to drive me crazy?

12:08.200 --> 12:09.820
Mr. Jin, it's all my fault.

12:09.960 --> 12:10.840
This is on me.

12:13.030 --> 12:14.090
Let me talk to them.

12:26.960 --> 12:30.090
This is not because you are dissatisfied
with Lin Zeqiu,

12:30.240 --> 12:31.320
nor is it because I didn't find

12:31.320 --> 12:32.720
a better person to marry.

12:35.870 --> 12:37.120
It's because I didn't listen
to your arrangements,

12:37.120 --> 12:38.510
and I got out of your control.

12:38.510 --> 12:40.040
That's why you are unhappy.

12:46.960 --> 12:47.510
Dad,

12:48.550 --> 12:49.120
Mom,

12:52.790 --> 12:53.870
how long has it been

12:55.200 --> 12:57.200
since we had a proper talk last time?

12:59.000 --> 13:01.440
You only criticize me,

13:02.200 --> 13:04.600
lecture me, and show disappointment in me.

13:05.910 --> 13:08.440
It feels like nothing I do
is ever good enough.

13:12.510 --> 13:14.440
But is this how we should get along?

13:21.550 --> 13:22.750
Dad, do you remember?

13:25.240 --> 13:26.510
When I was little, and you took me to sing

13:26.510 --> 13:27.970
in the Children's Palace,

13:29.000 --> 13:29.870
you told me,

13:30.670 --> 13:32.530
"Baihui, you should sing loudly,

13:33.240 --> 13:34.750
so I can hear your voice."

13:36.030 --> 13:38.120
So I sang with all my strength.

13:38.600 --> 13:40.290
No other kid could drown out my voice.

13:40.290 --> 13:42.020
Even the teacher laughed at me.

13:43.320 --> 13:44.030
Because that way,

13:44.030 --> 13:45.360
you could stand outside

13:46.000 --> 13:47.600
and hear your daughter sing.

13:49.480 --> 13:50.870
I finally stepped onto the stage

13:50.870 --> 13:53.200
at the school anniversary gala that year.

13:53.630 --> 13:55.090
I know you wouldn't agree,

13:55.440 --> 13:56.550
so I practiced

13:56.550 --> 13:57.670
and performed in secret.

13:57.670 --> 13:59.930
I felt so happy to be rebellious for once.

14:03.320 --> 14:05.360
But I kept staring at the audience,

14:07.390 --> 14:08.440
not because

14:09.670 --> 14:11.670
the students' cheers made me proud.

14:13.510 --> 14:16.170
I was actually trying to find you two
down there.

14:18.320 --> 14:19.250
I was wondering.

14:21.150 --> 14:22.790
If you saw me on stage,

14:24.440 --> 14:25.910
if you heard my voice,

14:27.150 --> 14:29.610
would you be
a little more satisfied with me?

14:32.270 --> 14:34.120
Would you be happier?

14:46.300 --> 14:47.000
Mom,

14:48.480 --> 14:49.810
after I started school,

14:51.320 --> 14:52.410
getting me into Qingbei University

14:52.410 --> 14:54.080
was your everything.

14:56.550 --> 14:58.010
You stayed up late with me,

14:58.440 --> 15:00.970
accompanied me to exams,
and studied with me.

15:02.240 --> 15:03.000
But how long has it been

15:03.000 --> 15:05.000
since you went on a proper vacation?

15:05.870 --> 15:09.070
How long has it been
since you truly lived for yourselves?

15:12.270 --> 15:13.120
I know

15:14.080 --> 15:15.810
how many cigarettes you smoked

15:16.550 --> 15:19.750
on the balcony, Dad,
when I had to repeat a grade that year.

15:20.240 --> 15:21.960
And Mom, I saw you crying secretly

15:21.960 --> 15:23.240
in the kitchen.

15:27.030 --> 15:29.240
I've been listening to you all these years

15:29.240 --> 15:29.960
because...

15:30.720 --> 15:32.750
It's not because I didn't dare to rebel.

15:32.750 --> 15:34.200
It's because I couldn't bear to rebel.

15:34.200 --> 15:36.670
I couldn't bear to see you hurt again.

15:51.630 --> 15:53.240
Actually, I feel that I'm quite a failure

15:53.240 --> 15:54.240
as a daughter.

15:59.550 --> 16:00.630
How did I

16:02.000 --> 16:04.600
lose the parents
who once loved me so much?

16:12.200 --> 16:12.910
Baihui.

16:19.080 --> 16:22.510
Dad just wanted you to live

16:24.000 --> 16:25.200
a happier life

16:26.120 --> 16:27.200
and go further.

16:39.240 --> 16:40.170
Mr. and Mrs. Jin,

16:41.600 --> 16:42.720
I understand

16:43.600 --> 16:44.550
your concerns.

16:46.270 --> 16:48.930
There is no parent
who doesn't love their child.

16:49.870 --> 16:51.400
Maybe one day in the future,

16:51.840 --> 16:53.170
when we become parents,

16:54.320 --> 16:56.650
we might make the same choice you've made.

16:58.270 --> 16:59.320
But today,

17:01.750 --> 17:02.910
I hope you two

17:04.310 --> 17:05.750
can give us a chance

17:06.550 --> 17:07.810
and trust us this once.

17:10.000 --> 17:11.069
I will do my best

17:12.640 --> 17:14.240
in the rest of my life to prove

17:15.000 --> 17:17.329
that I haven't betrayed your trust today,

17:17.680 --> 17:20.240
and that Jin Baihui made the right choice.

17:22.240 --> 17:23.160
Please

17:24.510 --> 17:25.550
give me a chance.

17:51.920 --> 17:52.750
I'm thirsty.

17:55.960 --> 17:57.020
Pour me a cup of tea.

17:59.270 --> 17:59.920
Mr. Jin.

18:09.920 --> 18:11.580
Please have some tea, Mr. Jin.

18:18.830 --> 18:20.590
Mrs. Jin, please have some tea.

18:22.590 --> 18:24.350
I didn't prepare a gift for you.

18:26.200 --> 18:27.510
No need, no need.

18:29.030 --> 18:29.960
Let's eat first.

18:42.980 --> 18:48.150
[Watch out for the train]

18:47.720 --> 18:49.180
You're finally back, man.

18:49.550 --> 18:51.240
I thought you weren't going to repay

18:51.240 --> 18:52.500
this last bit of money.

18:52.790 --> 18:53.550
No way.

18:54.200 --> 18:55.130
Give me a moment.

18:56.550 --> 18:59.680
[Watch out for the train]

19:02.870 --> 19:05.700
[Watch out for the train]

19:15.200 --> 19:16.600
This is the last payment.

19:16.920 --> 19:17.780
We are even now.

19:24.160 --> 19:25.620
You're really something.

19:26.110 --> 19:27.310
I never expected that

19:27.480 --> 19:29.680
you could pull through all these years.

19:30.030 --> 19:32.690
Actually, you didn't
have to repay it back then.

19:34.070 --> 19:34.750
But you still did it,

19:34.750 --> 19:36.920
so your family and friends
wouldn't suffer losses.

19:36.920 --> 19:37.920
You're a real man.

19:40.590 --> 19:41.680
Still, thank you

19:42.200 --> 19:44.130
for lending me the money back then.

19:44.400 --> 19:46.660
Contact me anytime if you need anything.

19:46.680 --> 19:48.790
After all,
we've known each other for years.

19:48.790 --> 19:49.440
Thanks.

20:07.570 --> 20:09.300
[Contacts]

20:09.420 --> 20:10.830
[Peng][More]

20:10.860 --> 20:12.410
[Delete Contact]

20:12.440 --> 20:14.560
[Delete this contact?]

20:14.630 --> 20:15.950
[Contacts]

20:50.510 --> 20:51.160
Zhixia,

20:51.400 --> 20:53.160
the project you're leading
has been included

20:53.160 --> 20:55.020
in the national key support list.

20:55.270 --> 20:57.680
But next,
the project is going to be upgraded,

20:57.680 --> 21:00.200
and we will face
more complex resource integration

21:00.200 --> 21:01.530
and management issues.

21:02.200 --> 21:05.200
Of course,
it will also receive greater support.

21:06.680 --> 21:08.080
So the school has decided

21:08.440 --> 21:10.590
to make Qianche lead the later work.

21:10.830 --> 21:13.760
You need to hand over the project
as soon as possible.

21:18.920 --> 21:19.780
I got replaced?

21:22.920 --> 21:23.830
But I have been in charge

21:23.830 --> 21:25.790
of this project from the very beginning.

21:25.790 --> 21:28.030
I'm familiar
with all the data and materials.

21:28.030 --> 21:30.000
I've even had a plan for the next step.

21:30.000 --> 21:32.460
How could you get me replaced
all of a sudden?

21:34.000 --> 21:34.750
Professor,

21:35.510 --> 21:37.700
this project was planned
and pushed forward

21:37.700 --> 21:38.830
by Lin Zhixia alone.

21:39.000 --> 21:40.570
I think she is fully capable

21:40.590 --> 21:42.510
of completing the follow-up work.

21:42.510 --> 21:44.040
Even if there's an upgrade,

21:44.270 --> 21:47.070
we don't need to change
the person in charge, do we?

21:47.510 --> 21:49.440
The operational difficulty
of a national project

21:49.440 --> 21:52.170
has increased
by more than an order of magnitude.

21:52.750 --> 21:54.070
With your current management experience,

21:54.070 --> 21:55.200
you can't handle it.

21:55.440 --> 21:56.840
At this stage, it would be

21:57.200 --> 21:58.730
better for Qianche to lead.

22:01.790 --> 22:04.270
No, I still think it's better

22:04.440 --> 22:06.960
for Lin Zhixia
to finish this project herself.

22:06.960 --> 22:08.270
She knows this project best.

22:08.270 --> 22:08.920
Qianche,

22:10.070 --> 22:11.200
there must be a reason

22:11.200 --> 22:12.930
for the school's arrangement.

22:15.030 --> 22:16.290
Don't you understand?

22:26.550 --> 22:28.480
Then what will I be responsible for

22:28.680 --> 22:29.810
after the handover?

22:30.920 --> 22:33.920
The school and the country
have higher expectations for you.

22:33.920 --> 22:35.680
As for your specific responsibilities,

22:35.680 --> 22:36.310
well,

22:37.070 --> 22:38.870
I'll tell you separately later.

22:49.720 --> 22:50.460
[Lin Zhixia]

22:54.560 --> 22:57.560
[Lin Zhixia]

22:59.510 --> 23:01.040
Why are you still up so late?

23:01.940 --> 23:03.000
I can't sleep.

23:03.550 --> 23:04.810
I want to chat with you.

23:09.590 --> 23:10.390
What's wrong?

23:11.200 --> 23:13.200
Did something happen at school?

23:14.070 --> 23:15.200
Ms. Wu asked me

23:16.590 --> 23:19.400
to hand the project over to Senior Tan.

23:21.160 --> 23:22.680
I know it's not a bad thing,

23:23.680 --> 23:26.140
but I still feel
a bit uncomfortable inside.

23:28.440 --> 23:30.000
I think anyone would

23:30.440 --> 23:32.640
feel uncomfortable in this situation.

23:32.830 --> 23:35.760
After all, it's a project
you've built from scratch.

23:35.830 --> 23:36.680
However,

23:36.790 --> 23:38.070
it doesn't necessarily mean the professor

23:38.070 --> 23:40.510
and the school
don't recognize your abilities.

23:40.510 --> 23:41.310
I think

23:41.920 --> 23:44.160
they probably want you
to focus your energy

23:44.160 --> 23:45.760
on more important research,

23:46.240 --> 23:46.920
right?

23:47.790 --> 23:50.390
He said there would be
new arrangements for me.

23:51.960 --> 23:53.200
But this project is something

23:53.200 --> 23:55.060
we've been in charge of all along.

23:55.590 --> 23:57.520
I was suddenly told to hand it over.

23:58.680 --> 24:01.160
It feels like I'm detached from something
I was a part of.

24:01.160 --> 24:02.310
I feel empty inside.

24:04.680 --> 24:05.440
Well,

24:06.750 --> 24:09.270
let me make an analogy
that may not be entirely accurate.

24:09.270 --> 24:11.270
This project is like a big tree.

24:11.960 --> 24:13.550
You helped it take root

24:14.160 --> 24:16.420
and built its foundation layer by layer.

24:17.070 --> 24:17.750
Therefore,

24:18.160 --> 24:19.610
no matter how tall and big

24:19.680 --> 24:21.340
its branches and leaves grow,

24:21.590 --> 24:22.990
as long as it's this tree,

24:23.310 --> 24:25.040
its roots will always be yours.

24:27.790 --> 24:29.400
So you mean,

24:29.590 --> 24:30.680
the roots are mine,

24:30.920 --> 24:32.980
but the tree belongs to someone else?

24:34.200 --> 24:35.270
Even if this tree

24:35.270 --> 24:37.310
ends up bearing someone else's name,

24:37.310 --> 24:38.000
Lin Zhixia,

24:38.680 --> 24:39.880
as long as you want to,

24:39.920 --> 24:41.440
you can even plant a whole forest

24:41.440 --> 24:42.640
easily in the future.

24:43.270 --> 24:44.730
Given your capabilities,

24:45.160 --> 24:47.620
there's no need
to hold onto one single tree.

24:51.680 --> 24:54.610
Jiang Yubai, why do you have
so much confidence in me?

24:56.160 --> 24:57.690
It's not about confidence.

24:58.270 --> 24:59.330
It's because I know

25:00.050 --> 25:02.580
you're the most amazing person
I've ever met.

25:04.960 --> 25:07.490
You have more faith in me
than I have in myself.

25:09.920 --> 25:11.400
Alright, time to sleep.

25:11.920 --> 25:14.920
I need to go to school
to hand it over tomorrow morning.

25:16.680 --> 25:17.340
Good night.

25:18.550 --> 25:19.210
Good night.

25:36.750 --> 25:38.810
Jiang Yubai, I'm missing you so much.

25:40.290 --> 25:43.300
[Lin Zhixia]

25:43.340 --> 25:45.290
[Jiang Yubai]

25:44.550 --> 25:45.910
I'm coming to see you now.

25:45.910 --> 25:49.640
[I'm coming to see you now.]

25:49.670 --> 25:52.710
[Jiang Yubai]

25:50.920 --> 25:52.680
It's too late. Let's meet this weekend.

25:52.680 --> 25:53.440
I'll go meet you.

25:52.760 --> 25:57.200
[Lin Zhixia]

25:54.570 --> 25:57.400
Okay, I actually have something
to tell you, too.

25:57.350 --> 25:58.700
[What is it?]

25:58.770 --> 26:02.000
[Lin Zhixia]

25:59.550 --> 26:00.510
What is it?

26:02.570 --> 26:04.010
You'll know soon.

26:04.510 --> 26:06.270
Go to sleep now. Good night.

26:05.590 --> 26:07.750
[Something good. You'll know soon.]

26:07.790 --> 26:08.940
[Go to sleep now. Good night.]

26:13.830 --> 26:14.590
Good night.

26:54.020 --> 26:58.000
[Fun Biking]

27:04.090 --> 27:07.210
[Fun Biking]

27:08.590 --> 27:10.070
Duan, come on in.

27:10.530 --> 27:18.390
[Fun Biking]

27:10.750 --> 27:11.410
Have a seat.

27:17.000 --> 27:18.030
Long time no see.

27:20.580 --> 27:25.140
[Fun Biking]

27:21.200 --> 27:22.070
Duan,

27:22.440 --> 27:22.960
look,

27:23.200 --> 27:25.460
we haven't seen you at the office lately,

27:25.510 --> 27:27.840
and everyone's lost their energy at work!

27:28.240 --> 27:29.070
The company

27:29.440 --> 27:31.040
really can't do without you.

27:32.680 --> 27:33.400
Just tell me

27:34.200 --> 27:35.400
what you want from me.

27:36.160 --> 27:37.680
Let's cut to the chase instead of

27:37.680 --> 27:39.080
beating around the bush.

27:41.000 --> 27:42.750
Why isn't Mr. Duan
making a fuss this time?

27:42.750 --> 27:44.790
I thought he'd definitely
chew us out a bit.

27:44.790 --> 27:46.050
He's so nice this time.

27:47.960 --> 27:48.960
Here's the thing.

27:49.400 --> 27:50.400
Remember

27:51.200 --> 27:54.200
the top tech expert you talked to before?

27:54.750 --> 27:57.080
I mean Dr. Zhou,
who came back from abroad.

27:57.780 --> 27:58.750
He is now

27:59.920 --> 28:01.590
very popular in the market.

28:02.070 --> 28:03.830
An investor has even made it clear

28:03.830 --> 28:05.270
that he will immediately invest in

28:05.270 --> 28:07.000
whichever company he chooses.

28:09.310 --> 28:10.030
So

28:11.400 --> 28:13.790
you want to hire Dr. Zhou now?

28:14.440 --> 28:15.070
Duan,

28:16.790 --> 28:18.200
I've always believed you were right.

28:18.200 --> 28:19.590
You're really farsighted.

28:19.590 --> 28:21.000
We all just...

28:21.000 --> 28:21.550
Okay.

28:24.440 --> 28:25.370
It's a deal then.

28:25.440 --> 28:27.200
I'll find a chance to talk to him.

28:27.200 --> 28:28.660
You're doing a good thing.

28:29.590 --> 28:30.200
Yes.

28:30.270 --> 28:31.000
However...

28:33.550 --> 28:35.240
Could you not make the meeting

28:35.240 --> 28:36.680
so tense?

28:36.920 --> 28:37.550
What?

28:37.800 --> 28:40.000
Are meetings this tense now without me?

28:40.030 --> 28:41.680
We need to be more lively, right?

28:41.680 --> 28:42.480
Yes, exactly.

28:42.680 --> 28:43.680
Why so tense?

28:43.680 --> 28:44.380
Yeah.

28:44.590 --> 28:46.590
I'll have someone
buy some snacks and drinks.

28:46.590 --> 28:48.240
Let's eat and talk. How about that?

28:48.240 --> 28:49.030
Nice.

28:49.200 --> 28:50.440
Good. What are we going to discuss?

28:50.440 --> 28:52.100
Everyone, get ready. Come on.

28:57.030 --> 28:58.200
Mr. Duan,

28:58.310 --> 29:01.160
what a rare occasion for you
to treat me to a meal for celebration.

29:01.160 --> 29:03.510
Do I need a reason to celebrate with you?

29:04.440 --> 29:05.550
Come on, cheers.

29:08.400 --> 29:11.000
You really helped me a lot
with getting this issue solved

29:11.000 --> 29:12.510
for my company this time.

29:12.920 --> 29:15.270
Besides, can't I just treat you to a meal?

29:16.000 --> 29:16.720
Yes, sure.

29:20.270 --> 29:22.670
You've grown up
and learned to be grateful.

29:26.920 --> 29:28.920
Why are you staring at me? Eat up now.

29:30.400 --> 29:30.960
Okay.

29:34.070 --> 29:34.800
Nice meat...

29:39.920 --> 29:40.850
Anything wrong?

29:42.990 --> 29:45.270
Tell me what you're cooking up again.

29:45.270 --> 29:47.530
Out with it
while I'm in a good mood today.

29:56.680 --> 29:57.830
I do have something

29:59.000 --> 30:01.050
that I want to get your take on.

30:07.550 --> 30:08.510
Well...

30:10.830 --> 30:12.440
A friend of mine

30:13.200 --> 30:14.790
has a beloved one

30:15.000 --> 30:16.820
and wants to confess his feelings to her.

30:16.820 --> 30:19.680
But they are childhood friends.

30:22.270 --> 30:23.920
So he doesn't know what to do.

30:28.940 --> 30:30.920
What's so hard about it?

30:31.070 --> 30:32.320
Just tell her directly.

30:32.320 --> 30:34.160
Calm down. Let me finish first.

30:36.790 --> 30:38.920
My friend is mainly afraid that

30:40.510 --> 30:42.170
if he confesses his love to her

30:42.510 --> 30:43.570
and gets rejected,

30:43.960 --> 30:44.590
or if

30:44.750 --> 30:45.960
they get together

30:46.240 --> 30:47.400
but break up later,

30:47.720 --> 30:49.920
they wouldn't even be friends anymore.

30:50.310 --> 30:51.310
This girl holds

30:52.510 --> 30:54.370
a very special place in his heart.

30:55.510 --> 30:56.200
So,

30:57.310 --> 30:58.310
what should he do?

31:01.590 --> 31:02.850
Which friend of yours?

31:03.960 --> 31:05.000
You don't know him.

31:05.000 --> 31:06.400
Never mind which friend.

31:06.490 --> 31:07.550
Just tell me

31:08.000 --> 31:09.160
your take on this.

31:10.310 --> 31:11.720
Which friend of yours don't I know?

31:11.720 --> 31:12.960
Just tell me who it is.

31:13.310 --> 31:15.750
Well... Forget about who it is for now.

31:15.920 --> 31:17.650
Just answer my question first.

31:17.680 --> 31:20.830
From a girl's perspective,

31:21.270 --> 31:23.680
do you think this girl would agree
to be together with him?

31:23.680 --> 31:24.440
Or rather,

31:24.680 --> 31:27.510
if your childhood friend
confesses his love to you,

31:27.510 --> 31:28.510
would you agree to be with him?

31:28.510 --> 31:29.160
No.

31:30.000 --> 31:33.400
Who would date their childhood friends?
That's ridiculous.

31:38.310 --> 31:39.510
She is

31:39.510 --> 31:40.680
not you.

31:40.790 --> 31:42.000
Maybe she thinks

31:42.440 --> 31:44.070
that growing up together

31:44.440 --> 31:45.440
and knowing each other well

31:45.440 --> 31:47.790
would make
for a good romantic relationship.

31:47.790 --> 31:48.510
Right?

31:51.960 --> 31:53.070
Y-Yeah.

31:55.400 --> 31:56.400
Eat up.

32:17.750 --> 32:19.350
A friend of mine

32:20.200 --> 32:21.720
has a beloved one

32:21.920 --> 32:23.790
and wants to confess his feelings to her.

32:23.790 --> 32:26.510
But they are childhood friends.

32:32.240 --> 32:35.100
If your childhood friend
confesses his love to you,

32:35.160 --> 32:36.000
would you agree to be with him?

32:36.000 --> 32:36.680
No.

32:37.510 --> 32:40.910
Who would date their childhood friends?
That's ridiculous.

32:47.310 --> 32:48.550
Maybe she thinks

32:48.960 --> 32:50.680
that growing up together

32:51.030 --> 32:52.030
and knowing each other well

32:52.030 --> 32:54.560
would make
for a good romantic relationship.

33:09.570 --> 33:10.070
You...

33:10.590 --> 33:11.310
What are you doing?

33:11.310 --> 33:13.270
So what if we're childhood friends?

33:13.270 --> 33:15.400
Can't childhood friends fall in love?

33:15.440 --> 33:16.920
I like you, Tang Tingting.

33:26.440 --> 33:27.200
Duan Qiyan.

33:27.920 --> 33:28.830
It's too tight. It hurts.

33:28.830 --> 33:29.510
Let go!

33:30.590 --> 33:31.990
If you still don't let go,

33:32.610 --> 33:33.920
I'll stop liking you.

33:44.190 --> 33:47.120
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

33:47.840 --> 33:50.580
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

33:51.060 --> 33:53.340
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

33:53.690 --> 33:57.430
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

33:58.270 --> 34:00.610
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

34:01.440 --> 34:04.200
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

34:05.020 --> 34:07.620
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

34:08.219 --> 34:11.480
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

34:12.360 --> 34:15.400
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

34:16.010 --> 34:18.670
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

34:19.449 --> 34:25.110
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

34:26.060 --> 34:29.120
♪ Myself ♪

34:33.030 --> 34:35.280
You never pursued me properly.

34:39.880 --> 34:40.810
Then I'll make up

34:41.409 --> 34:42.940
for the past 20 years first.

34:43.139 --> 34:45.920
♪ Let the wind pass you ♪

34:46.670 --> 34:49.630
♪ Let the dream hug you ♪

34:50.120 --> 34:52.380
♪ Let my tears turn into your ♪

34:52.790 --> 34:56.360
♪ Tide sinking into your eyes ♪

34:57.030 --> 34:59.560
♪ As I told you ♪

35:00.490 --> 35:03.280
♪ I'll never respond again ♪

35:04.040 --> 35:06.590
♪ I thought I could ♪

35:07.070 --> 35:10.510
♪ Forget ♪

35:11.340 --> 35:14.360
♪ Listen to the night breeze whispering ♪

35:15.000 --> 35:17.610
♪ It says the rain ceases
and clouds disperse ♪

35:18.240 --> 35:24.170
♪ The rarest blessing in life
is a sweet dream ♪

35:25.150 --> 35:27.280
Isn't this restaurant too expensive?

35:28.630 --> 35:29.510
It's fine.

35:30.840 --> 35:32.240
Today is very important.

35:34.550 --> 35:35.750
What's so important?

35:39.400 --> 35:40.190
I've paid off

35:40.960 --> 35:42.000
all my debts.

35:45.550 --> 35:46.680
Great, Jiang Yubai.

35:46.960 --> 35:48.160
You are finally free.

35:52.590 --> 35:53.390
Here's to you.

35:54.880 --> 35:57.440
For finally getting through
the hard times,

35:58.150 --> 35:59.000
and also for

35:59.230 --> 36:00.560
being able to live a life

36:00.760 --> 36:02.490
with peace and ease from now on.

36:04.590 --> 36:05.360
Thank you

36:06.630 --> 36:08.030
for never giving up on me.

36:21.030 --> 36:21.840
These years,

36:23.550 --> 36:25.350
I've had a hard time struggling.

36:26.800 --> 36:29.150
I've cut off all contact with the world.

36:30.710 --> 36:33.440
It felt like
my life was all about paying off debts

36:34.070 --> 36:35.800
with no room for anything else.

36:37.630 --> 36:38.360
But you are

36:39.670 --> 36:41.270
like my last trace of gravity

36:41.800 --> 36:44.130
that I can't bear to
let go of in this world.

36:45.690 --> 36:46.290
Thank you

36:48.030 --> 36:49.290
for not giving up on me.

36:51.510 --> 36:53.770
Because we're binary-star companions.

36:54.630 --> 36:56.590
We revolve around the same center.

36:57.440 --> 36:58.630
I'm your gravity,

36:58.920 --> 37:00.030
and you're mine.

37:01.110 --> 37:03.590
We'll keep orbiting each other forever.

37:05.550 --> 37:08.080
And Lin Zhixia
will love Jiang Yubai forever.

37:11.670 --> 37:12.510
Lin Zhixia,

37:14.360 --> 37:15.890
let's never be apart again.

37:31.800 --> 37:32.590
Jiang Yubai.

37:33.690 --> 37:36.890
What do you want to do
now that your debts are paid off?

37:40.150 --> 37:42.010
What's with the sudden question?

37:43.000 --> 37:44.330
I'm doing great now.

37:45.280 --> 37:46.210
I make good money

37:46.880 --> 37:48.210
with quite a stable job.

37:49.360 --> 37:50.320
People are lining up

37:50.320 --> 37:52.580
and even paying extra to buy my products.

37:58.880 --> 38:00.630
But why do I always feel that

38:01.360 --> 38:03.490
you're not really that into your work?

38:10.110 --> 38:11.310
What makes you say so?

38:13.190 --> 38:14.000
First of all,

38:15.360 --> 38:16.670
you never initiate a conversation

38:16.670 --> 38:18.000
with me about your work.

38:18.920 --> 38:19.670
Secondly,

38:20.360 --> 38:21.880
out of everything you do,

38:22.630 --> 38:24.090
you're only excited about

38:24.250 --> 38:25.840
those related to physics.

38:26.880 --> 38:27.590
Thirdly,

38:28.250 --> 38:30.150
you don't seem happy during most

38:30.150 --> 38:31.410
of your working hours.

38:40.840 --> 38:41.880
You always see

38:43.630 --> 38:45.160
right through me like this.

38:46.440 --> 38:48.280
So, what do you want to do next?

38:50.110 --> 38:51.550
I want to apply to a grad program

38:51.550 --> 38:52.360
in physics.

38:55.360 --> 38:56.000
Great!

38:56.590 --> 38:57.400
This is a good idea!

38:57.400 --> 38:58.200
I support you.

39:00.670 --> 39:02.170
Jiang Yubai can finally do

39:02.190 --> 39:04.130
what he likes!

39:08.510 --> 39:09.710
This is the you I know.

39:34.030 --> 39:35.440
These lines are so great.

39:37.150 --> 39:40.190
You die when you're forgotten by everyone.

39:41.880 --> 39:43.740
As long as someone remembers you,

39:44.920 --> 39:46.520
you won't really disappear.

39:50.710 --> 39:51.360
Yeah.

39:53.480 --> 39:56.210
My classmates have seen
movies in dome theaters,

39:57.000 --> 39:58.550
in 3D,

39:59.400 --> 40:00.880
and on IMAX screens.

40:01.800 --> 40:05.590
But they definitely haven't watched one
projected in a hospital ward.

40:05.590 --> 40:06.550
I scored a point.

40:11.710 --> 40:13.070
When you recover,

40:14.000 --> 40:15.730
you can continue your studies,

40:15.880 --> 40:16.630
fall in love,

40:17.110 --> 40:17.880
get married,

40:18.590 --> 40:19.590
and see the world.

40:22.880 --> 40:24.610
You can score many more points.

40:26.840 --> 40:29.100
Then I definitely won't study medicine.

40:30.110 --> 40:32.170
I've really had enough of hospitals.

40:34.840 --> 40:37.400
Then what do you want to do?

40:40.960 --> 40:42.420
I want to be a ship captain.

40:42.670 --> 40:45.070
It's so free
to sail through wind and waves.

40:49.070 --> 40:49.840
No way.

40:50.190 --> 40:51.840
I'd better stay on land.

40:52.880 --> 40:54.280
I like crowded places,

40:54.920 --> 40:56.250
with hustle and bustle.

40:57.510 --> 40:59.880
I'll open a drink stall at a night market.

41:00.880 --> 41:04.140
When the clock strikes 12,
I'll treat everyone to milk tea.

41:04.590 --> 41:05.920
When everyone is happy,

41:05.920 --> 41:07.320
they'll all surround me,

41:07.670 --> 41:08.960
singing and dancing,

41:09.150 --> 41:10.550
wishing for prosperity.

41:10.880 --> 41:12.010
It'll be so much fun.

41:13.840 --> 41:14.920
I want to

41:15.510 --> 41:17.440
sell swim rings by the pool,

41:18.590 --> 41:19.590
with the colorful ones

41:19.590 --> 41:20.920
filling the whole pool.

41:22.280 --> 41:23.400
I want to

41:24.150 --> 41:26.280
open a cat cafe by the school gate.

41:27.320 --> 41:28.880
I also want to...

41:29.590 --> 41:30.510
Sounds great.

41:55.510 --> 41:56.320
Dr. Shen,

41:58.110 --> 42:00.770
what does it feel like
to be in love with someone?

42:02.510 --> 42:05.310
I haven't had the chance
to love someone properly.

42:11.510 --> 42:12.970
Being in love with someone

42:15.070 --> 42:16.270
makes you very happy.

42:18.960 --> 42:19.840
Sometimes...

42:23.590 --> 42:24.790
it also makes you sad.

42:29.590 --> 42:32.430
It sounds like the feeling of being alive.

42:49.440 --> 42:50.710
The movie says

42:52.150 --> 42:53.630
a person dies 3 times.

42:55.710 --> 42:56.670
The first time is

42:57.880 --> 42:59.540
when the heart stops beating.

43:01.070 --> 43:02.070
The second time is

43:03.440 --> 43:04.770
when you're forgotten,

43:06.190 --> 43:08.190
and people no longer talk about you.

43:10.920 --> 43:11.920
The third time is

43:14.190 --> 43:16.880
when the last person in the world
who remembered you

43:16.880 --> 43:17.960
forgets you, too.

43:27.880 --> 43:28.630
Dr. Shen,

43:30.360 --> 43:32.090
I'm a bit scared all of a sudden.

43:33.550 --> 43:36.440
If one day
no one in the world remembers me,

43:37.550 --> 43:39.750
would it really be as if I never existed?

43:47.960 --> 43:49.490
I will always remember you.

44:00.190 --> 44:01.070
Dr. Shen,

44:03.070 --> 44:04.470
I will remember you, too.

44:07.670 --> 44:10.930
Even if I am forgotten
by the last person who remembered me,

44:11.110 --> 44:13.640
before falling
into the boundless darkness,

44:15.110 --> 44:17.040
I will still remember you for sure.

44:24.960 --> 44:25.690
Pinky swear.

44:43.920 --> 44:45.920
Dao, go load the luggage first.

44:46.360 --> 44:47.670
I'll have a word with Dr. Shen.

44:47.670 --> 44:48.000
Okay.

45:09.510 --> 45:10.150
Take this

45:11.110 --> 45:11.910
as a keepsake.

45:14.030 --> 45:15.360
Next time you are bored,

45:15.440 --> 45:17.240
you can take it out and look at it.

45:29.260 --> 45:31.790
[Hematology Department Shen Fuxuan]

45:34.280 --> 45:35.480
Stick it on yourself.

45:38.340 --> 45:41.430
[Hematology Department Shen Fuxuan]

45:52.340 --> 45:55.010
[Hematology Department, Shen Fuxuan]

46:07.760 --> 46:11.030
[Huacheng City Hejia Hospital]

46:21.970 --> 46:24.010
[Hematology Department, Shen Fuxuan]

47:04.960 --> 47:05.710
Dr. Shen.

47:07.960 --> 47:08.960
Treat me to a movie

47:09.840 --> 47:11.590
when I get back, would you?

47:13.670 --> 47:15.510
I'll pay for every movie you want to watch

47:15.510 --> 47:16.570
after you get back.

47:18.710 --> 47:20.370
That's going to cost you a lot.

47:29.440 --> 47:30.170
I'm leaving.

47:49.840 --> 47:51.190
Shui, I...

48:02.920 --> 48:03.670
Goodbye,

48:04.110 --> 48:05.000
Dr. Shen.

48:56.630 --> 48:57.360
Liu,

48:58.150 --> 49:00.150
I'm going to apply to a grad program.

49:02.280 --> 49:03.880
You've finally come around.

49:04.400 --> 49:05.800
I told you long ago

49:06.710 --> 49:07.970
that it would be a waste

49:08.360 --> 49:09.630
of your talent to be

49:10.150 --> 49:11.150
just a craftsman.

49:12.400 --> 49:14.840
Since you want to apply to a grad program,

49:15.070 --> 49:17.360
try to be my student.

49:17.840 --> 49:18.550
How's it?

49:19.440 --> 49:20.570
I'm not interested.

49:22.400 --> 49:23.590
How arrogant.

49:24.360 --> 49:26.320
So what are you interested in?

49:28.320 --> 49:29.380
Particle physics.

49:32.190 --> 49:33.670
Are you crazy, boy?

49:34.920 --> 49:36.030
This major is

49:36.320 --> 49:37.880
unpopular and hard to get into.

49:37.880 --> 49:40.740
It's also not easy
to achieve results in the future.

49:41.030 --> 49:42.000
I don't care.

49:42.630 --> 49:44.510
You should just follow me.

49:45.070 --> 49:47.150
I can teach you this, too.

49:48.070 --> 49:48.800
Liu,

49:49.360 --> 49:51.360
I know what you're thinking.

49:51.670 --> 49:53.320
If I become your student,

49:53.440 --> 49:55.110
I'll have to fish with you every day.

49:55.110 --> 49:57.030
I'll also have to work for you
when I'm free,

49:57.030 --> 49:58.230
like fixing speakers

49:58.320 --> 49:59.920
and modifying fishing rods.

50:01.190 --> 50:02.880
Fish with me every day?

50:03.880 --> 50:06.010
You think I like seeing your sour face?

50:06.360 --> 50:08.880
I'm just afraid
you will fail in your application, okay?

50:08.880 --> 50:11.800
Do you think it's that easy
to apply to a grad program?

50:11.800 --> 50:12.670
Besides,

50:13.630 --> 50:16.360
so many people are
dying to be my students.

50:16.920 --> 50:18.280
Don't be ungrateful.

50:19.710 --> 50:20.510
Don't worry.

50:21.360 --> 50:22.360
If I fail,

50:23.000 --> 50:24.600
I'll fish with you every day.

50:30.150 --> 50:34.500
[Confidential Files]

50:37.150 --> 50:37.960
Zhixia,

50:38.320 --> 50:39.090
I need to talk to you

50:39.090 --> 50:40.240
about something

50:40.260 --> 50:41.520
extremely important.

50:42.150 --> 50:43.000
I know

50:43.630 --> 50:45.550
your project
has been going very smoothly lately,

50:45.550 --> 50:47.280
and your team is very cohesive.

50:47.710 --> 50:49.840
But the school just received a notice.

50:49.960 --> 50:50.960
Our country has

50:51.110 --> 50:52.770
a high-level classified research project

50:52.770 --> 50:54.960
that we're
looking for suitable talent to join.

50:54.960 --> 50:56.820
Your name is at the top of the list.

51:00.510 --> 51:01.770
A classified project?

51:03.190 --> 51:04.520
What do you want me to do?

51:05.110 --> 51:06.800
The work isn't much different from

51:06.800 --> 51:08.200
your research at school.

51:08.510 --> 51:11.150
With your abilities,
you should be able to adapt quickly.

51:11.150 --> 51:12.750
The only difference is that,

51:12.960 --> 51:14.070
from the moment you are transferred,

51:14.070 --> 51:16.000
you must devote yourself
entirely to the work

51:16.000 --> 51:17.660
in a closed-off environment.

51:17.710 --> 51:18.840
Due to the significance of the project,

51:18.840 --> 51:20.970
strict confidentiality is required.

51:21.030 --> 51:23.000
You cannot reveal anything

51:23.320 --> 51:24.880
even to your closest friends.

51:24.880 --> 51:26.540
This is a matter of principle.

51:28.710 --> 51:30.510
This is a very rare opportunity.

51:32.120 --> 51:34.310
Working on a major national project

51:35.030 --> 51:36.690
may not bring you recognition

51:36.880 --> 51:38.000
right away,

51:38.630 --> 51:39.670
but its results

51:40.840 --> 51:42.050
will push a certain field

51:42.050 --> 51:43.440
forward by a giant leap.

51:45.920 --> 51:47.110
As a researcher,

51:47.840 --> 51:49.100
you might get this kind

51:49.670 --> 51:51.870
of opportunity only once in a lifetime.

52:09.550 --> 52:10.360
Leave it there.

52:10.360 --> 52:11.420
I'll wash it later.

52:17.960 --> 52:19.960
W-What did you just say?

52:34.190 --> 52:36.320
Did something happen when you got back

52:36.960 --> 52:38.150
from school today?

52:41.360 --> 52:42.360
I can't tell you.

52:49.800 --> 52:51.070
You can't even tell me?

52:53.180 --> 52:55.840
Professor Wu told me
not to tell anyone about it.

52:56.360 --> 52:57.150
Fine.

52:57.930 --> 52:59.330
If you're not telling me,

52:59.880 --> 53:00.710
let me guess.

53:02.000 --> 53:02.960
Is it about work?

53:05.670 --> 53:08.510
Is it about the project
you were transferred from?

53:12.670 --> 53:14.110
Your previous project

53:14.670 --> 53:16.710
was already a key national project.

53:17.770 --> 53:20.320
The fact that they transferred you
away from it

53:20.320 --> 53:23.380
means there's a more important project
that needs you.

53:24.510 --> 53:25.970
So you can't talk about it.

53:28.730 --> 53:29.720
I'll ask no more.

53:39.030 --> 53:40.320
If I go,

53:43.880 --> 53:46.210
we might not see each other
for a long time.

53:59.320 --> 54:00.510
Actually, I feel

54:01.670 --> 54:02.730
the same way you do.

54:04.320 --> 54:06.030
If this is what you want to do,

54:07.400 --> 54:08.530
you have my support.

54:09.880 --> 54:12.410
I hope you can become the person
you want to be.

54:13.880 --> 54:15.010
For all these years,

54:16.400 --> 54:18.530
you've been my only source of comfort.

54:20.000 --> 54:20.840
Now,

54:22.360 --> 54:24.060
it's time for me to be your support.

54:24.060 --> 54:29.840
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

54:31.220 --> 54:37.140
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

54:38.030 --> 54:43.600
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

54:45.050 --> 54:52.190
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

54:53.370 --> 55:00.000
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

55:00.650 --> 55:06.180
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

55:06.970 --> 55:09.860
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

55:10.730 --> 55:13.490
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

55:14.090 --> 55:16.180
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

55:16.720 --> 55:20.340
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

55:21.110 --> 55:23.510
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

55:24.360 --> 55:27.180
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

55:27.860 --> 55:30.460
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

55:31.080 --> 55:34.460
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

55:35.270 --> 55:38.320
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

55:38.860 --> 55:41.610
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

55:42.200 --> 55:48.130
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

55:44.440 --> 55:46.100
Professor Wu Qingxi said that

55:46.260 --> 55:49.930
["The Universe, the Stars, and You"]

55:46.360 --> 55:48.070
this kind of confidential project

55:48.070 --> 55:49.280
could be

55:48.730 --> 55:52.100
♪ Myself ♪

55:50.150 --> 55:53.150
a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity
for a researcher.

55:54.000 --> 55:56.840
But I must leave the city,

55:57.320 --> 55:58.250
leave my family,

55:59.070 --> 56:00.330
and leave Jiang Yubai.

56:01.710 --> 56:04.510
Yet Jiang Yubai told me without hesitation

56:05.070 --> 56:06.550
that he would be my support

56:07.400 --> 56:08.460
and let me fly high.

56:11.000 --> 56:13.480
He is like my Einstein field equation.

56:14.150 --> 56:17.610
Just like the curvature of spacetime
and the motion of matter,

56:17.800 --> 56:19.030
we are bound together.
